WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:32.950
The Final Test

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:47.410
Where are we?

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:49.200
It's the Tablet of Memories.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.340
We're back in the real world.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:52.890
Everyone...

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:56.340
Where's the other Yug-  I mean, Atem?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:59.470
Did he make it back with us?

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.610
My other self…

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.840
I’m right here.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.010
Atem!

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:10.120
Thank goodness!

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:11.980
Everyone, thank you.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:17.230
If you didn't come to help me, I may not have won the Shadow Game.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.120
Don’t get mushy.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.360
We’re always here for you.

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:26.360
That’s right.  You’re our dear friend.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:30.400
But you let Bakura control you so easily.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.640
Let's forget about that!

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:36.520
You need to be more careful.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:39.640
Knock it off, Jonouchi.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:44.340
3,000 years ago, the priests helped me.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.630
And now, my friends helped me.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:48.640
Atem.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.890
Can I still call you my other self?

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:57.060
Because we’re still sharing the same body.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.170
Of course, partner.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:04.330
I’m glad we made it back safely.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:08.350
For a while, I wasn’t sure how things would turn out.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.840
So it wasn’t a dream.

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:14.220
Yugi!

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:20.480
You need it, right?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.470
The Millennium Eye?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.990
Why did you have it?

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:26.660
Kaiba…

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:27.940
Hey, Kaiba!

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.190
Hold up!  Explain yourself!

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:39.780
Bakura!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:43.140
Huh?  Where am I?

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:46.920
Where?  Don’t you remember anything?

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:52.810
Someone was chasing me...  and then...

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.200
Hang on, Bakura!

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:57.960
Bakura!

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.470
I’m starving.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.930
He passed out.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.040
Bakura!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.610
Sheesh.  Let's take him outside.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.150
You should hold on to this.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:15.830
Yeah.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.060
Let’s go, Honda!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.240
There's no evil inside the Millennium Ring.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.900
Bakura was also a victim.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.430
Anzu, give us a hand!

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.730
Okay!

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:42.260
Shadi, your soul is gone.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:43.900
Thank you.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:53.540
Seto, the world of memories is different than what really happened.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.680
But when I was sealed inside the Millennium Puzzle...

00:04:56.680 --> 00:05:00.620
...you successfully protected the kingdom as the Pharaoh.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:05.260
And you created this Tablet of Memories for me.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:10.000
Now that Zorc is gone, I can once again…

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.500
My other self.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.140
Let’s go, partner.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.280
Kaiba.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:28.900
Pharaoh, you were able to recover your memories.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:29.690
Yes.

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:34.460
The gravekeepers' duty is finally over.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:39.000
Yes.  The seven Millennium Items are all together.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.330
All that's left is...

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:45.710
I'll seal them up so that they never fall into anyone's hands again.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:46.910
Seal?

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.830
That’s my final mission.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:58.010
I know.  But this means your soul will return to the afterlife, right?

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:05.420
Pharaoh.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:12.190
The Tablet of the Afterlife is located in a shrine protected by the tombkeepers.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.410
Tablet of the Afterlife!

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:20.360
The inscription inside the shrine reads:

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:25.020
"To open the door to the afterlife, insert the seven Millennium Items in the tablet."

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:28.100
"For the final key, say the Pharaoh’s name."

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:29.730
The Pharaoh’s name...

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:30.610
Atem.

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:34.880
Atem?  So that’s the Pharaoh's name.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.390
This means all the requirements are met.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:42.380
Are you ready?

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:43.640
Yes.

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:51.060
I’ll guide you to the Shrine of the Afterlife.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.790
We're not going by airplane?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:11.080
The tablet's location can only be reached by boat.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.160
C'mon, it's fine.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.020
A relaxing cruise is awesome!

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:18.190
Don't be silly-

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:25.670
Y-Yeah!  No need to rush!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.740
That’s right.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:35.240
In ancient Egypt, boats ferried religious followers and Pharaohs to the land of the dead.

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.120
Land of the dead?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:41.900
The land of the dead lies to the west - where the sun sets.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.960
That’s where the Shrine of the Afterlife is located.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:50.450
So for us, traveling there by boat may hold special meaning.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.060
Hey!

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:56.360
Yugi!  Over here!

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:57.340
Grandpa?

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.460
Otogi?

00:07:58.460 --> 00:07:59.720
And Mokuba!

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.400
What took you so long?

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.820
Big brother!

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:07.920
Mokuba...

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:11.460
We were getting tired waiting for you.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:12.980
Why are you here?

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:18.930
As soon as you left, I had a sudden desire to come to Egypt.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.890
As if I had no choice.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:25.100
I just returned home from overseas and went to visit you.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:29.170
But since you were here, we came together.

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:32.780
We met Mokuba at the airport.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.330
You left without saying a word, so I came after you.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:42.040
Sorry.  I needed to see something with my own eyes.

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:48.510
I was worried because I couldn't contact you.

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:53.530
Otogi, no sane person would've come all the way to Egypt.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.170
C'mon now.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:09:00.520
If it's important to you, you should let us know.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.720
Sorry, Otogi.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:06.800
I wanted to tell everyone, but it happened so quickly.

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:08.120
Who's "everyone"?

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.520
Everyone who knows Yugi.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.720
I managed to reach several of them.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:18.840
I’m sure they're thinking of you, even though they're far away.

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.010
It's finally time, Yugi boy.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:31.290
This may be due to destiny.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:40.560
I acquired the Millennium Eye and created Duel Monsters based on the tablets I found in Egypt.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:49.080
Perhaps destiny made me create it to lead to this day.

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:51.000
It’s pretty, but a little sad.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.200
Yugi…

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:57.060
Why are you coming along anyway?

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:58.640
None of your business!

00:10:58.640 --> 00:10:59.970
Right, big brother?

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:03.780
Kaiba...

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:08.750
He must see how this ends with his own eyes.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:12.520
Since he's also guided by destiny.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.340
Destiny…

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:15.500
Yugi.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:19.840
There’s something I need to tell you.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:20.920
Marik…

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:26.930
The inscription inside the shrine also mentions a battle ritual.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.440
Battle ritual?

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:48.160
A battle ritual?

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.690
The Pharaoh should also hear this.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:54.420
The inscription says:

00:11:54.420 --> 00:12:00.940
"The Pharaoh's soul cannot depart or rest without a sword in his hand."

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:03.710
What’s that supposed to mean?

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:07.200
The sword is a tool for fighting.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.080
For duelists, that will be our cards.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.710
Cards...

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:15.640
You place down your cards when you lose a duel.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:21.720
Does this mean someone has to duel my other self and defeat him?

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.720
I see.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:30.380
If someone ends Yugi's battle legacy, his spirit will be released.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:36.340
But who?  There aren't many duelists who can defeat him.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:49.710
Yugi, doesn’t this take you back?

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:55.120
Riding a ship at night - it reminds me of going to Duelist Kingdom.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:56.590
Yeah.

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:59.960
Yugi, I have a favor to ask.

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:03.670
Throw the Millennium Items into this river.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:09.000
Just joking!

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.170
Jonouchi!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.940
I've decided I’m dueling Atem.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:15.370
Jonouchi!

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:16.430
Jonouchi!

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:17.450
That's crazy!

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:19.120
Yeah!  So?

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:21.140
I’ll duel Atem and-

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:22.680
Step aside, amateur.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:24.540
Kaiba!

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:32.130
If this is the final duel, I’ll get my revenge by performing his last rites!

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.840
Kaiba…

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.760
Kaiba, you punk!

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:37.790
I had first dibs!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.210
You punk!

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:46.540
I came here to settle things with you- I mean with the other Yugi!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.240
This time, I'll be the victor!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.550
Kaiba…  You're right.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:58.320
You did keep fighting against my other self.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.090
Then it’s decided.

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.290
But sorry.

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:06.460
I’ll duel my other self.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:07.590
What?

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:09.640
Yugi…

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.400
This is one thing I have to do myself.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.760
Fine.

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:19.560
It's your decision.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:21.040
Jonouchi…

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.620
This is ridiculous!

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:26.970
You're not good enough to defeat the other Yugi!

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.420
Knock it off, Kaiba!

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:31.560
This is something I have to do!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:38.560
Yugi!

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:40.200
Mokuba.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.330
Kaiba!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:47.350
Yugi, use these cards.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:50.850
So that you can duel him at your best.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:54.110
Use these to build a perfect deck.

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:56.470
Thank you, Kaiba.

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:59.480
But I don't need them.

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.550
What?

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:07.210
I want to build a deck using the cards me and my other self used to battle together.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.130
Yugi…

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:10.890
Have it your way.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:13.310
Wait, big brother!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.790
Kaiba…

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:22.050
Hello?

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.460
Do you have a sec?

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.040
Anzu?  What's up?

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:31.550
Ishizu said we’ll arrive at the Shrine of the Afterlife in the morning.

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:32.920
I see.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:38.420
You’re really going to duel the other Yugi.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:43.380
Yeah.  Because it's the last thing I can do for my other self.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.140
That's not true!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.440
Did the other Yugi say anything?

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:54.180
He’s hiding deep inside me.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:58.080
He plans to stay there until I’ve built my deck.

00:15:58.480 --> 00:15:59.540
I see.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:03.720
They've made up their minds.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.350
Anzu?

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.240
It’s nothing.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.700
I just came to tell you about tomorrow.

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:14.050
Don’t work too hard.  Good night.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.100
Good night.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:21.960
Anzu came here to see my other self.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:23.980
Sorry.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:33.520
The other Yugi-  Atem doesn't belong in this era.

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:39.280
If he can go home, I shouldn’t try to stop him.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:50.990
It took me eight years to reassemble the Millennium Puzzle.  And on that day...

00:16:57.760 --> 00:17:03.970
You entered my soul, and we've been together since.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:11.020
Since you were with me, I gained courage and slowly grew stronger.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:16.450
Which is why this time, I'll use all my strength to help you.

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:22.170
Jonouchi!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:25.420
Are you really okay with this?

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:29.980
This is your last chance to duel the other Yugi.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.980
I used to be really weak.

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:38.740
I even lost against elementary school kids.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:42.920
But I never thought of quitting.

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:47.040
As I battled the other Yugi, dueling became more fun.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.720
And I grew stronger.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:51.520
I looked up to him.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.530
Jonouchi.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.030
That's why I want to fulfill his wishes.

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:00.210
Yugi’s the only opponent for him.

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.060
Yeah.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.540
You’re right.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:12.310
You will fight against the Gods in this duel.

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:14.650
How will you duel, Yugi?

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:18.590
Do you really think you can defeat the Gods and win?

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:36.430
Until now, me and my other self built our deck together.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:39.580
But this deck is mine alone.

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:42.710
A deck to battle against my other self.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:49.990
It’s ready.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:02.640
Finished building your deck, partner?

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.000
My other self.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.750
You’ve been waiting for me to finish my deck.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.370
Yeah.

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:12.870
I can't look at my opponent's deck before the duel.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:17.740
Thank you for accepting my final test.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:23.380
I’ll duel you with all my strength.

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:24.880
Right!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:28.160
It’s your turn to build your deck.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:32.150
I know your previous decks' weaknesses.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:36.660
So my new deck has ways to defeat it.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:40.160
If you underestimate me, you’ll regret it.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.440
I’ll go hide deep in my soul.

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:53.800
In truth, I don’t want to duel you.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:59.690
But if we don’t, you can't leave my soul.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:04.070
My mission is to defeat you.

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:07.120
There's no time left.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:11.600
I’d rather be talking with you, but…

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:17.980
When duelists decide to battle each other, there's only silence between them.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:26.240
I’ve battled many opponents.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:30.010
But this will be the hardest one.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:36.390
My partner accepted this battle ritual to determine my fate.

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:39.900
This test isn't just for me.

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:45.410
My partner put his whole heart into the deck contained inside this box.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:48.410
Partner...

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:52.670
I’ll also put my whole heart into building my deck.

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:05.460
It's done!  My strongest deck!

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:09.070
This battle will determine my fate.

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:13.230
Will I win and stay?  Or lose and go to the future?

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:15.740
Let’s battle, partner!

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.010
You’re late, Yugi!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:32.150
Everyone...

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:34.750
Yugi…

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:37.840
Let’s get going!

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:39.020
Yeah!

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:12.770
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:28.490
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:29.210 --> 00:22:34.330
Without a goal in mind

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:42.900
We just step towards our dream

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:48.540
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:48.730 --> 00:22:57.010
Your eye will find it

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:02.820
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:10.960
Will touch your soul

00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:14.220
In a duel

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:28.980
The battle ritual is the final test for the other Yugi.

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:33.800
Why does Yugi and the other Yugi have to battle each other?

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:37.750
If Yugi wins, the other Yugi will...

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:44.830
The seven Millennium Items are placed in the Tablet of the Afterlife, starting their duel.

00:23:44.830 --> 00:23:48.560
Who should we root for?

00:23:48.560 --> 00:23:51.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Last Duel of Destiny

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:52.890
Duel, standby!
